{"id":"10c4730632b56f5c","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-tower.md","title":"Tower","display":"df-tower — Tower","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-tower","aliases":["58-df-tower"],"display":"df-tower — Tower","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-tower"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-tower</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tower — Tower"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\theta,\\vec T\\in V\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa,\\theta,\\vec T\\in V\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\kappa]^\\kappa\\coloneqq\\{X\\subseteq\\kappa:|X|=\\kappa\\}\">\\([\\kappa]^\\kappa\\coloneqq\\{X\\subseteq\\kappa:|X|=\\kappa\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\cdot|:V\\to V\">\\(|\\cdot|:V\\to V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subseteq^*_\\kappa\\;\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)^2\">\\(\\subseteq^*_\\kappa\\;\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)^2\\)</span> (mod-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\kappa\">\\(&lt;\\kappa\\)</span> inclusion defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TowerSequence}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\operatorname{Tower}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{TowerSequence}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\operatorname{Tower}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tower\\text{-}almost\\text{-}inclusion} \\vdash X\\subseteq^*_\\kappa Y\\leftrightarrow X,Y\\subseteq\\kappa\\land|X\\setminus Y|&lt;\\kappa\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tower\\text{-}almost\\text{-}inclusion} \\vdash X\\subseteq^*_\\kappa Y\\leftrightarrow X,Y\\subseteq\\kappa\\land|X\\setminus Y|&lt;\\kappa\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tower\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\operatorname{TowerSequence}_S(\\vec T,\\theta,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec T,\\theta,[\\kappa]^\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\beta&lt;\\theta\\;(\\vec T(\\beta)\\subseteq^*_\\kappa\\vec T(\\alpha)\\land\\neg(\\vec T(\\alpha)\\subseteq^*_\\kappa\\vec T(\\beta)))\\land\\neg\\exists X\\in[\\kappa]^\\kappa\\;\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\theta\\;(X\\subseteq^*_\\kappa\\vec T(\\alpha))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tower\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\operatorname{TowerSequence}_S(\\vec T,\\theta,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec T,\\theta,[\\kappa]^\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\beta&lt;\\theta\\;(\\vec T(\\beta)\\subseteq^*_\\kappa\\vec T(\\alpha)\\land\\neg(\\vec T(\\alpha)\\subseteq^*_\\kappa\\vec T(\\beta)))\\land\\neg\\exists X\\in[\\kappa]^\\kappa\\;\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\theta\\;(X\\subseteq^*_\\kappa\\vec T(\\alpha))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tower\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\operatorname{Tower}(\\mathcal T,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\theta,\\vec T\\;(\\operatorname{TowerSequence}_S(\\vec T,\\theta,\\kappa)\\land\\mathcal T=\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec T))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tower\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\operatorname{Tower}(\\mathcal T,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\theta,\\vec T\\;(\\operatorname{TowerSequence}_S(\\vec T,\\theta,\\kappa)\\land\\mathcal T=\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec T))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Towers are strictly decreasing modulo sets of cardinality <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\kappa\">\\(&lt;\\kappa\\)</span> and have no size-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> pseudointersection.</li>\n<li>The classical tower invariant uses <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa=\\omega\">\\(\\kappa=\\omega\\)</span>; the displayed form is the mod-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\kappa\">\\(&lt;\\kappa\\)</span> generalization.</li>\n<li>The existence of towers relates to cardinal invariants.</li>\n<li>The indexed family is now a registered set function and every occurrence uses its application; the former symbols <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\alpha\">\\(T_\\alpha\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\beta\">\\(T_\\beta\\)</span> were not bound to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec T\">\\(\\vec T\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../bat